{"steam_appid":1501690,"steam_name":"Dice Kingdoms","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1501690/435335/6e942909c6bf5154c488068fb9fd64fa47541937/1750695702/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1712317410","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256871132/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1712317410","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/ss_9739f9fd3647ab532a399707e4c29f5931968574.1920x1080.jpg?t=1712317784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/ss_364fdc856ed2be2ff82c7b7c1454512911e4d2e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1712317784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/ss_8e8da6522f8b006db8ba6b2c1a0f96f612fe5e7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1712317784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/ss_aaedc59c74c92fecd26e82156a0d094616b02f16.1920x1080.jpg?t=1712317784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/ss_3d51a3fc7a30f8c201dce2d33faea8beb888c720.1920x1080.jpg?t=1712317784"],"about_the_game":"Dice Kingdoms is a multiplayer turn-based strategy game where each player must develop their island and compete for victory through culture, military conquest or building an expensive wonder.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/e54ba5869de4dc51097831430b6439a4.poster.avif?t=1712317784\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/e54ba5869de4dc51097831430b6439a4.webm?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/e54ba5869de4dc51097831430b6439a4.mp4?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Strategically prioritize what to build<br></li><li> Efficiently layout your city, anticipating attacks and diseases while optimizing for space</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/2032a16657c5c5e289651daf16f2eae7.poster.avif?t=1712317784\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/2032a16657c5c5e289651daf16f2eae7.webm?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/2032a16657c5c5e289651daf16f2eae7.mp4?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build specialized houses to have more dice<br></li><li> Use rerolls to try to get the resources you need the most but risk natural disasters</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/aaebe2e18ef94e921f7c442c5e6d211f.poster.avif?t=1712317784\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/aaebe2e18ef94e921f7c442c5e6d211f.webm?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/aaebe2e18ef94e921f7c442c5e6d211f.mp4?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Automatic battles after choosing targets<br></li><li> Pillage of strategic buildings yields many resources<br></li><li> Use force to punish greedy development</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disasters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/55189cf00a216da773c575e5f735eaa3.poster.avif?t=1712317784\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/55189cf00a216da773c575e5f735eaa3.webm?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501690/extras/55189cf00a216da773c575e5f735eaa3.mp4?t=1712317784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Natural disasters are determined by the number of skulls rolled<br></li><li> Some natural disasters affect yourself while some affect other players</li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Fivemid Studio"],"publishers":["Fivemid Studio"],"release_date":"5 Apr, 2024"}